    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Asset records with more than one AssetStatePeriod where IsCurrent = true.
Why it matters: An asset can have only one current state — multiple current periods break billing engine logic and produce duplicate or wrong invoices.
Suppress a finding: never; fix the periods.
Disable the detector: leave on.</value></values>
